        "fr": "Changer le mode de charge",
        "de": "Lademodus einstellen",
        "es": "Cambiar el modo de carga"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "On an openWB chargepoint. Stop is always allowed, the others need control.",
        "fr": "Sur un point de charge openWB. Arrêt toujours permis, les autres demandent le pilotage.",
